      {
        "id": 225174,
        "name": "nexus77777",
        "username": "nexus77777",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/59ef9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-07T18:54:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Sea-Envy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/48/1849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Sea-Envy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Sk8-Blayde was normal continuity just imagine Extreamaverse Sk8-Blayde.</p>\n<p>Unless that like brings him around 180 and he is boring and safe over there.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>There’s no way Xtreme Sk8-Blayde only does a 180! Xtreme Sk8-Blayde does a full 1080&nbsp;before pushing his board’s afterburners&nbsp;to FULL THROTTLE and tearing open a rift&nbsp;into next week!! <strong>guitar riff</strong></p>\n<p>Or maybe there’s a Blayde-verse, similar to the Omnitron universe. Denizens include&nbsp;Sir8-Blayde, a mad scientist who’s city of Swordengrad has banned non-serrated knives. Also&nbsp;F8-Remayde, a villain who tips probability in her favor, and&nbsp;Sk8-Pomayde, who sells totally authentic Shmeanie Shmabies out of his space van.</p>\n<p>Actually, Fate Remade isn’t a bad character name. <em>stashes away for RPG</em></p>",
        "post_number": 27,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:58:45.156Z",
